Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: For collision check has physics before same vehicle

A part of Leaf(https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/blob/dev/1.21.9/leaf-server/minecraft-patches/features/0078-For-collision-check-has-physics-before-same-vehicle.patch)

